{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1515","id":4020929921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vqoWB","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1515","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1515.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1515.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1515","number":1515,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[V1-MS-REVEAL-RUNTIME-HVY-11] Run MS reveal launch rehearsal","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1497.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis runs the end-to-end V1 MS reveal launch rehearsal for the 9709 slice after #1496 landed on `main`. It adds the launch-level builder, validator, readback, and regression tests that combine the runtime rehearsal, read-model rehearsal, route receipt, frontend fixture/smoke artifacts, product display posture, visual QA receipt, screenshot asset manifest, and self-assessment runtime receipt.\n\nThe rehearsal covers the required flows: located page reveal after submitted answer, student-confirmed attempt reveal, same-page neighbor warning, document_only fallback, ambiguous fallback, rights/product blocked fallback, visual QA failed/blocked fallback with real visual QA evidence IDs, teacher/admin preview, invalid student preview rejection, and self-assessment submitted without secure/exam-ready uplift.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.validator-result.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/post-attempt-ms-reveal-browser-network-smoke.v1.json`\n- Existing frontend integration smoke/receipt/validator artifacts were refreshed for deterministic latency/readability fields.\n- `post-attempt-ms-self-assessment-runtime-receipt.v1.json` was refreshed only for the dependent frontend artifact SHA updates.\n\n## Launch Gate Results\n\n- `launch_readiness`: `ready_with_caveats`\n- `pre_attempt_reveal_exposure_count`: `0`\n- `frontend_preload_exposure_count`: `0`\n- `public_static_url_allowed_count`: `0`\n- `student_display_candidate_without_visual_qa_count`: `0`\n- `automatic_scoring_claim_count`: `0`\n- `self_assessment_secure_or_exam_ready_uplift_count`: `0`\n- `max_image_byte_size_threshold`: `500000`\n- `oversized_image_asset_count`: `0`\n- `compressed_derivative_count`: `0`\n- `mobile_readability_fail_count`: `0`\n- `reveal_route_latency_p95_ms`: `1` for the deterministic local mocked-route smoke\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run build`\n- `node scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-smoke.mjs`\n- `NODE_PATH=\"$(npm root -g)\" npx --yes playwright test -c scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-reveal-browser-network-smoke.playwright.config.mjs --reporter=line --workers=1`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-self-assessment-runtime.mjs`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-read-model-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-fixtures.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-self-assessment-runtime.test.js src/api/__tests__/learningRuntimeApi.test.js api/learning/__tests__/ms-source-reveal-asset-api.test.js src/components/learning-runtime/__tests__/LearningSessionShell.test.js src/components/learning-runtime/__tests__/view-models.test.js src/components/learning-runtime/__tests__/ms-source-self-assessment.test.js src/pages/learning-runtime/__tests__/learning-runtime-route-transitions.test.js`\n- `npm run lint:changed`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true ./node_modules/.bin/eslint scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-source-reveal-frontend-smoke.mjs scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-reveal-browser-network-smoke.pw.cjs scripts/smoke/post-attempt-ms-reveal-browser-network-smoke.playwright.config.mjs scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nKnown command warnings: Vite reports stale Browserslist data and an existing large chunk warning; AO preflight reports warning status because this AO branch is `feat/issue-1497` rather than `task/` or `codex/`, and because the worktree was dirty before commit.\n","created_at":"2026-07-09T09:38:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T09:55:43Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T09:55:43Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T09:55:42Z","merge_commit_sha":"74a4fa0da84b91da1531daa0d7938bef2ae43106","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github